Draft logo for wikinews. From [[m:Image:Wikinews-draftlogo.png]].  {{PD}}

As of this writing, this image is the only image in the Wikinews image space. (See [[Special:Imagelist]].)

Uploading is currently disabled on Wikinews, so all other images are uploaded on [[Commons:Main_Page|the Wikimedia Commons]].

Wikinews logo.
